@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Customer
participant "Angular App" as UI
participant "Ocelot Gateway" as GW
participant "UnderwritingService" as UW
participant "PolicyBillingService" as PB
participant "PolicyBillingDb" as DB

Customer -> UI : Open approved underwriting offer
UI -> GW : GET /underwriting/api/customer/underwriting/{id}
GW -> UW : Read customer-facing underwriting state
UW --> GW : Approved offer + completion deadline
GW --> UI : Approved offer

Customer -> UI : Choose effective date + payment frequency
UI -> GW : POST /policies/api/purchases/{applicationId}/configure
GW -> PB : Validate offer + build schedule preview
PB -> UW : GET /internal/underwriting/{id}/approval
UW --> PB : Approved non-lapsed offer context
PB --> GW : Schedule preview
GW --> UI : Review purchase configuration

Customer -> UI : Accept offer
UI -> GW : POST /policies/api/purchases/{applicationId}/accept
GW -> PB : Record acceptance
PB -> UW : Revalidate approved offer
UW --> PB : Valid
PB --> GW : Purchase created / payment required
GW --> UI : Payment screen

Customer -> UI : Pay first installment
UI -> GW : POST /policies/api/purchases/{purchaseId}/payments
GW -> PB : Simulate payment
PB -> DB : Atomic payment + policy issuance transaction
DB --> PB : Policy + schedule + PDF metadata committed
PB --> GW : Payment successful + issued Policy
GW --> UI : Policy issued
UI --> Customer : Policy number + document + schedule
@enduml
